  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if a soul sin, and hear the voice of swearing, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a witness, whether he hath seen or known",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if he do not utter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then he shall bear his iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or if a soul touch any unclean thing, whether",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a carcase of an unclean beast, or a carcase of unclean cattle, or the carcase of unclean creeping things, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it be hidden from him; he also shall be unclean, and guilty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or if he touch the uncleanness of man, whatsoever uncleanness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that a man shall be defiled withal, and it be hid from him; when he knoweth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then he shall be guilty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or if a soul swear, pronouncing with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lips to do evil, or to do good, whatsoever",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that a man shall pronounce with an oath, and it be hid from him; when he knoweth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", then he shall be guilty in one of these.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be, when he shall be guilty in one of these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that he shall confess that he hath sinned in that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thing:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall bring his trespass offering unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for his sin which he hath sinned, a female from the flock, a lamb or a kid of the goats, for a sin offering; and the priest shall make an atonement for him concerning his sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if he be not able to bring a lamb, then he shall bring for his trespass, which he hath committed, two turtledoves, or two young pigeons, unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; one for a sin offering, and the other for a burnt offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall bring them unto the priest, who shall offer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the sin offering first, and wring off his head from his neck, but shall not divide",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asunder:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall sprinkle of the blood of the sin offering upon the side of the altar; and the rest of the blood shall be wrung out at the bottom of the altar: it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sin offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall offer the second",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a burnt offering, according to the manner: and the priest shall make an atonement for him for his sin which he hath sinned, and it shall be forgiven him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But if he be not able to bring two turtledoves, or two young pigeons, then he that sinned shall bring for his offering the tenth part of an ephah of fine flour for a sin offering; he shall put no oil upon it, neither shall he put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "frankincense thereon: for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sin offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall he bring it to the priest, and the priest shall take his handful of it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a memorial thereof, and burn",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on the altar, according to the offerings made by fire unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sin offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
